<%- include('partials/header') %>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <div class="homeProducts">
        <div class="productsContainer">
            <% jewelryProducts.slice(0,5).forEach(product => { %>
                <div class="productItem">
                    <img src="<%= product.image %>" alt="<%= product.name %>">
                    <h2><a href="/products/<%= product.id %>"><%= product.name %></a></h2>
                    <p><%= product.description %></p>
                    <p class="price">$<%= product.price %></p>
                    <button class="addToCartBtn" data-product-id="<%= product.id %>">Add to Cart</button>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        </div>
        <div class="seeMoreContainer">
            <img src="/photos/Jems Logo Gem-resize.png" alt="Jems Creations Logo">
            <a class="seeMoreBtn" href="/products">See More →</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="welcome">
        <img src="/photos/jaepic.jpg" alt="Jaeley Image">
        <p>Welcome to Jems Creations! <br>
            My name is Jaeley and I am currently a sophmore in highschool, participating in cross country, track, FFA, and more. I show pigs during the summer and enjoy singing, country dancing, and spending as much time as I can with my friends and family.
            <br>I handcraft every piece, blending wood, resin, and creativity so no two are alike- jewelry as unique as the one who wears it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process">
        <h2>How It's Made</h2>
        <p>Each piece begins with selecting high-quality wood, which is then carefully cut, sanded, and shaped to create a unique base for each jewelry item. Next, I mix resin with vibrant pigments and sometimes add glitter or small embellishments to enhance the design. The resin is then poured into molds containing the wooden pieces, creating a beautiful fusion of natural and synthetic materials. After curing, each piece is meticulously sanded and polished to achieve a smooth finish, ready to be transformed into stunning jewelry.</p>
        <img src="/photos/process5.jpg" alt="Process Collage">
        <img src="/photos/process4.jpg" alt="Process Collage 2">
        <img src="/photos/process1.jpg" alt="Process Collage 3">
        <img src="/photos/process2.jpg" alt="Process Collage 4">
    </div>
    
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>